         0, "The Shine-Dalgarno sequence (5'-AGGAGG-3') located upstream of the initiator AUG on prokaryotic mRNA base-pairs directly with a complementary pyrimidine-rich sequence (3'-UCCUCCA-5') near the 3' end of 16S rRNA in the 30S ribosomal subunit.",
